{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026pUaJYU9ZB31792853695.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>德國警方拘捕一名疑犯，調查是否與南部山區、二戰納粹德國高層使用的別墅火災有關。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.GER.FIRE-2301_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026P7bSc4SD2S1792853781.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>起火的別墅名為「鷹巢」，位於巴伐利亞州阿爾卑斯山區，於1938年完工，作為希特勒等納粹德國高層的休憩處。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.GER.FIRE-2300.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PzC2S27DnH1792852123.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>火警當地周五晚上發生，當局出動約二百名消防員撲救，翌日早上仍有煙冒出。警方指，該幢位於海拔約1,800米的建築物幾乎完全燒毀。疑犯在現場附近被拘留，犯案動機有待調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T16:01:11.299959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T13:36:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T22:59:01.395521+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T15:58:14.573252+00:00","content_hash":"bf10ed1607a713efc60d21aec8d55249201e5925a0cf15cb523cf062f19a1f07","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}